{
    "title": "NumMatch: Logic Puzzle",
    "description": "NumMatch - Logic puzzle is the perfect relaxing number game \ud83e\udde9. \r\n\r\nThis game is perfect if you like Sudoku, Number Match, Ten Crush, Crossword puzzles, or any number games. Train your logic and concentration skills, and try to beat your high score in the numbers game! \r\n\r\nImmerse yourself in the world of math number games! Playing this game will let you relax, especially after a work day; solving a free puzzle every day will train your brain and maths skills. Become a match number master!\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udde9 HOW TO PLAY \ud83e\udde9:\r\n\r\n\u2713 The goal is to clear all the numbers from the board.\r\n\u2713 Find pairs of equal numbers (1 and 1, 7 and 7) or pairs that add up to 10 (6 and 4, 3 and 7) on the number grid.\r\n\u2713 The pairs can be cleared vertically, horizontally, and even diagonally when there is no barrier between them and at the end of one line and the beginning of the next.\r\n\u2713 When no matches are on the board, press \u2795 to add new numbers on the puzzle pages.\r\n\u2713 If you get stuck in this logic game, Hints are available to help you progress. \r\n\u2713 Try to clear the numbers on the board to achieve the highest score.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udde9 DAILY CHALLENGE AND GIFT \ud83e\udde9\r\n\r\nFor extra fun, we have prepared something special for you. Play Nummatch Journey with 100 new block puzzle games every week for free! Each NumMatch puzzle has a different goal: collect gems and excellent awards!\r\n\r\nEnjoy your daily achievements and unlock cool badges, which will cheer you up!\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udde9 FEATURE \ud83e\udde9\r\n\r\n\u2713 Play easy with no pressure or time limit.\r\n\u2713 Unlimited free Hints - Stuck? No worries, easily continue with one tap!\r\n\u2713 Play every day and complete daily challenges or seasonal events to get unique trophies.\r\n\u2713 Gorgeous visuals paired with delightful sound effects.\r\n\u2713 Update hundreds of new puzzles every week.\r\n\u2713 Play anytime and anywhere. No WiFi connection is required!\r\n\r\nWith beautiful graphics and intuitive gameplay, NumMatch is a must-have app for anyone who loves number puzzle games. This game is perfect if you like Sudoku, Ten Crush, Take Ten, Ten Match, Merge Number, CrossMath, Math Puzzles, or any other number games. Solving a daily puzzle will help you with logic, memory, and math skills training! This Number Match teaches you to estimate, think quickly, and strategize by planning your next moves.\r\n\r\nNumMatch Logic Puzzle is the perfect way to test your problem-solving skills and train your brain. So what are you waiting for? Experience the addictive NumMatch today!\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions or concerns, please do not hesitate to contact us at support@matchgames.io",
    "descriptionHTML": "NumMatch - Logic puzzle is the perfect relaxing number game \ud83e\udde9. <br><br>This game is perfect if you like Sudoku, Number Match, Ten Crush, Crossword puzzles, or any number games. Train your logic and concentration skills, and try to beat your high score in the numbers game! <br><br>Immerse yourself in the world of math number games! Playing this game will let you relax, especially after a work day; solving a free puzzle every day will train your brain and maths skills. Become a match number master!<br><br>\ud83e\udde9 HOW TO PLAY \ud83e\udde9:<br><br>\u2713 The goal is to clear all the numbers from the board.<br>\u2713 Find pairs of equal numbers (1 and 1, 7 and 7) or pairs that add up to 10 (6 and 4, 3 and 7) on the number grid.<br>\u2713 The pairs can be cleared vertically, horizontally, and even diagonally when there is no barrier between them and at the end of one line and the beginning of the next.<br>\u2713 When no matches are on the board, press \u2795 to add new numbers on the puzzle pages.<br>\u2713 If you get stuck in this logic game, Hints are available to help you progress. <br>\u2713 Try to clear the numbers on the board to achieve the highest score.<br><br>\ud83e\udde9 DAILY CHALLENGE AND GIFT \ud83e\udde9<br><br>For extra fun, we have prepared something special for you. Play Nummatch Journey with 100 new block puzzle games every week for free! Each NumMatch puzzle has a different goal: collect gems and excellent awards!<br><br>Enjoy your daily achievements and unlock cool badges, which will cheer you up!<br><br>\ud83e\udde9 FEATURE \ud83e\udde9<br><br>\u2713 Play easy with no pressure or time limit.<br>\u2713 Unlimited free Hints - Stuck? No worries, easily continue with one tap!<br>\u2713 Play every day and complete daily challenges or seasonal events to get unique trophies.<br>\u2713 Gorgeous visuals paired with delightful sound effects.<br>\u2713 Update hundreds of new puzzles every week.<br>\u2713 Play anytime and anywhere. No WiFi connection is required!<br><br>With beautiful graphics and intuitive gameplay, NumMatch is a must-have app for anyone who loves number puzzle games. This game is perfect if you like Sudoku, Ten Crush, Take Ten, Ten Match, Merge Number, CrossMath, Math Puzzles, or any other number games. Solving a daily puzzle will help you with logic, memory, and math skills training! This Number Match teaches you to estimate, think quickly, and strategize by planning your next moves.<br><br>NumMatch Logic Puzzle is the perfect way to test your problem-solving skills and train your brain. So what are you waiting for? Experience the addictive NumMatch today!<br><br>If you have any questions or concerns, please do not hesitate to contact us at support@matchgames.io",
